WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.779
It was the first day of summer vacation.

2
00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:16.644
"Yay!" said Harry.

3
00:00:16.645 --> 00:00:20.321
"No more school!"

4
00:00:20.322 --> 00:00:25.971
"I'm glad school is over," said Emmy.

5
00:00:25.972 --> 00:00:29.855
"Summer is much more fun!"

6
00:00:29.856 --> 00:00:36.412
"What should we do first?" asked Harry.

7
00:00:36.413 --> 00:00:38.497
"Hmm . . . ," said Emmy.

8
00:00:38.498 --> 00:00:46.304
"I know! Let's ride our bikes to the park."

9
00:00:46.305 --> 00:00:52.391
Emmy and Harry rode to the park.

10
00:00:52.392 --> 00:00:57.509
They climbed on the monkey bars.

11
00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:09.647
They fed bread to the ducks.

12
00:01:09.648 --> 00:01:12.901
Then they rode home.

13
00:01:12.902 --> 00:01:16.690
"What should we do next?" asked Harry.

14
00:01:16.691 --> 00:01:22.146
The sun felt very hot.

15
00:01:22.147 --> 00:01:26.188
"Let's go under the sprinkler!" said Emmy.

16
00:01:26.189 --> 00:01:30.410
Emmy and Harry put on their swimsuits.

17
00:01:30.411 --> 00:01:34.520
Mom turned on the sprinkler.

18
00:01:34.521 --> 00:01:39.172
Emmy and Harry ran through the cool spray.

19
00:01:39.173 --> 00:01:43.993
"This is fun!" said Harry.

20
00:01:43.994 --> 00:01:50.348
"It's much better than school," said Emmy.

21
00:01:50.349 --> 00:01:56.294
Next Harry and Emmy played cards.

22
00:01:56.295 --> 00:02:02.712
Then they ate ice pops.

23
00:02:02.713 --> 00:02:07.867
They went roller-skating.

24
00:02:07.868 --> 00:02:19.298
They played tag and hide-and-seek.

25
00:02:19.299 --> 00:02:36.621
They played fetch with Rover.

26
00:02:36.622 --> 00:02:39.694
"Now what should we do?" asked Harry.

27
00:02:39.695 --> 00:02:45.860
Emmy shrugged. "I don't know," she said.

28
00:02:45.861 --> 00:02:49.615
Later Mom came into the family room.

29
00:02:49.616 --> 00:02:53.406
Emmy and Harry were just sitting there.

30
00:02:53.407 --> 00:02:57.389
"What's wrong?" Mom asked.

31
00:02:57.390 --> 00:03:01.977
"We're tired," moaned Harry.

32
00:03:01.978 --> 00:03:05.884
"We're bored," moaned Emmy.

33
00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:16.430
"When does school start again?"

